(xiii)
to create with the approval of the Board of Secondary Education teaching, administrative, ministerial and inferior posts
and to make appointments thereto in accordance with the Rules, laid down in that regard;
(xiv)
to appoint teaching and other staff in vacancies in the existing posts, to grant extension of service and to impose
penalties on such members of the staff in accordance with the Rules prescribed in that regard;
(xv)
to exercise, administrative and disciplinary control on the members of the teaching and other staff of the school, subject
to the Rules prescribed in that regard;
